{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-ui-compose-mp","title":"共享 UI (Compose Multiplatform)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/shared-ui-compose-mp","wordCount":482,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享-ui-compose-multiplatform\">共享 UI (Compose Multiplatform)</h1><p>Compose Multiplatform 是 JetBrains 基于 Jetpack Compose 开发的跨平台 UI 框架，允许在 Android、iOS、Desktop 和 Web 之间共享声明式 UI 代码。它将 Kotlin Multiplatform 的代码共享能力从业务逻辑层扩展到了 UI 层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 的核心是<strong>把 KMP 的共享边界从逻辑层推进到 UI 层</strong>：声明式 Composable 作为公共代码编写一次，在各平台由对应的渲染后端承接，平台专属 UI 则以互操作方式嵌入。其架构问题归结为——哪些界面能共享、哪些必须平台实现，以及导航与主题如何在两者间保持一致。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"架构概览\">架构概览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[共享 Composable UI] --&gt; B[Android Compose]&#10;    A --&gt; C[iOS UIKit 桥接]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Desktop Swing/AWT]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Web Canvas/DOM]&#10;&#10;    F[共享业务逻辑 commonMain] --&gt; A&#10;    F --&gt; G[平台特定代码 expect/actual]\">graph TD\n    A[共享 Composable UI] --&gt; B[Android Compose]\n    A --&gt; C[iOS UIKit 桥接]\n    A --&gt; D[Desktop Swing/AWT]\n    A --&gt; E[Web Canvas/DOM]\n\n    F[共享业务逻辑 commonMain] --&gt; A\n    F --&gt; G[平台特定代码 expect/actual]</pre><p>Compose Multiplatform 的分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>共享程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UI 组件</td>\n<td>Composable 函数、布局</td>\n<td>✅ 完全共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主题/样式</td>\n<td>MaterialTheme、颜色、字体</td>\n<td>✅ 完全共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导航</td>\n<td>页面路由、导航图</td>\n<td>✅ 大部分共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台 UI</td>\n<td>状态栏、系统对话框</td>\n<td>❌ 平台特定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"共享-composable-编写\">共享 Composable 编写</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain/kotlin/ui/UserCard.kt&#10;@Composable&#10;fun UserCard(user: User, onClick: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    Card(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .padding(8.dp)&#10;            .clickable { onClick() }&#10;    ) {&#10;        Row(&#10;            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),&#10;            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;        ) {&#10;            Icon(&#10;                imageVector = Icons.Default.Person,&#10;                contentDescription = null,&#10;                modifier = Modifier.size(48.dp)&#10;            )&#10;            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(16.dp))&#10;            Column {&#10;                Text(&#10;                    text = user.name,&#10;                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium&#10;                )&#10;                Text(&#10;                    text = user.email,&#10;                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall,&#10;                    color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain/kotlin/ui/UserCard.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun UserCard(user: User, onClick: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .padding(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clickable { onClick() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                imageVector = Icons.Default.Person,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier.size(48.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(16.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    text = user.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    text = user.email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"共享屏幕组合\">共享屏幕组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain/kotlin/ui/UserListScreen.kt&#10;@Composable&#10;fun UserListScreen(viewModel: UserViewModel) {&#10;    val users by viewModel.users.collectAsState()&#10;    val isLoading by viewModel.isLoading.collectAsState()&#10;&#10;    Scaffold(&#10;        topBar = {&#10;            TopAppBar(title = { Text(&quot;用户列表&quot;) })&#10;        }&#10;    ) { padding -&gt;&#10;        if (isLoading) {&#10;            Box(&#10;                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize(),&#10;                contentAlignment = Alignment.Center&#10;            ) {&#10;                CircularProgressIndicator()&#10;            }&#10;        } else {&#10;            LazyColumn(&#10;                modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)&#10;            ) {&#10;                items(users) { user -&gt;&#10;                    UserCard(user = user, onClick = { viewModel.selectUser(user) })&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain/kotlin/ui/UserListScreen.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun UserListScreen(viewModel: UserViewModel) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val users by viewModel.users.collectAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading by viewModel.isLoading.collectAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        topBar = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TopAppBar(title = { Text(\"用户列表\") })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { padding -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isLoading) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentAlignment = Alignment.Center</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                CircularProgressIndicator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LazyColumn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                items(users) { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    UserCard(user = user, onClick = { viewModel.selectUser(user) })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"平台特定-ui\">平台特定 UI</h2><p>某些 UI 元素天然与平台绑定，需要通过 expect/actual 处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Composable&#10;expect fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean)&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;expect fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -&gt; Unit)&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean) {&#10;    val view = LocalView.current&#10;    LaunchedEffect(isDarkTheme) {&#10;        val window = (view.context as Activity).window&#10;        WindowCompat.getInsetsController(window, view)&#10;            .isAppearanceLightStatusBars = !isDarkTheme&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    BackHandler(onBackPressed = onBack)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean) {&#10;    // iOS 通过 Info.plist 或 SwiftUI 配置&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;actual fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    // iOS 无系统返回按钮，可选实现手势&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -> Unit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val view = LocalView.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(isDarkTheme) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val window = (view.context as Activity).window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WindowCompat.getInsetsController(window, view)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .isAppearanceLightStatusBars = !isDarkTheme</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BackHandler(onBackPressed = onBack)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun StatusBarEffect(isDarkTheme: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // iOS 通过 Info.plist 或 SwiftUI 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun PlatformBackHandler(onBack: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // iOS 无系统返回按钮，可选实现手势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"导航\">导航</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 的导航方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 使用 Voyager 或自定义导航&#10;sealed class Screen {&#10;    data object UserList : Screen()&#10;    data class UserDetail(val userId: Long) : Screen()&#10;    data object Settings : Screen()&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppNavigation() {&#10;    var currentScreen by remember { mutableStateOf&lt;Screen&gt;(Screen.UserList) }&#10;&#10;    when (val screen = currentScreen) {&#10;        is Screen.UserList -&gt; UserListScreen(&#10;            onUserClick = { userId -&gt; currentScreen = Screen.UserDetail(userId) },&#10;            onSettingsClick = { currentScreen = Screen.Settings }&#10;        )&#10;        is Screen.UserDetail -&gt; UserDetailScreen(&#10;            userId = screen.userId,&#10;            onBack = { currentScreen = Screen.UserList }&#10;        )&#10;        is Screen.Settings -&gt; SettingsScreen(&#10;            onBack = { currentScreen = Screen.UserList }&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 Voyager 或自定义导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class Screen {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object UserList : Screen()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class UserDetail(val userId: Long) : Screen()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Settings : Screen()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var currentScreen by remember { mutableStateOf&#x3C;Screen>(Screen.UserList) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (val screen = currentScreen) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is Screen.UserList -> UserListScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onUserClick = { userId -> currentScreen = Screen.UserDetail(userId) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onSettingsClick = { currentScreen = Screen.Settings }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is Screen.UserDetail -> UserDetailScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            userId = screen.userId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onBack = { currentScreen = Screen.UserList }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is Screen.Settings -> SettingsScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onBack = { currentScreen = Screen.UserList }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; UserList&#10;    UserList --&gt; UserDetail : 点击用户&#10;    UserList --&gt; Settings : 点击设置&#10;    UserDetail --&gt; UserList : 返回&#10;    Settings --&gt; UserList : 返回\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; UserList\n    UserList --&gt; UserDetail : 点击用户\n    UserList --&gt; Settings : 点击设置\n    UserDetail --&gt; UserList : 返回\n    Settings --&gt; UserList : 返回</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"资源管理\">资源管理</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 提供了跨平台的资源管理方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain/composeResources/&#10;//   drawable/logo.png&#10;//   values/strings.xml&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppLogo() {&#10;    Image(&#10;        painter = painterResource(Res.drawable.logo),&#10;        contentDescription = &quot;应用 Logo&quot;&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun GreetingText() {&#10;    Text(text = stringResource(Res.string.welcome_message))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain/composeResources/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   drawable/logo.png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   values/strings.xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppLogo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Image(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        painter = painterResource(Res.drawable.logo),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = \"应用 Logo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun GreetingText() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Text(text = stringResource(Res.string.welcome_message))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>目录</th>\n<th>使用方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图片</td>\n<td><code>composeResources/drawable/</code></td>\n<td><code>painterResource(Res.drawable.xxx)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td><code>composeResources/values/strings.xml</code></td>\n<td><code>stringResource(Res.string.xxx)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字体</td>\n<td><code>composeResources/font/</code></td>\n<td><code>Font(Res.font.xxx)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"主题共享\">主题共享</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppTheme(&#10;    darkTheme: Boolean = isSystemInDarkTheme(),&#10;    content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    val colorScheme = if (darkTheme) darkColorScheme(&#10;        primary = Color(0xFF90CAF9),&#10;        secondary = Color(0xFFA5D6A7)&#10;    ) else lightColorScheme(&#10;        primary = Color(0xFF1976D2),&#10;        secondary = Color(0xFF388E3C)&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    MaterialTheme(&#10;        colorScheme = colorScheme,&#10;        typography = AppTypography,&#10;        content = content&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppTheme(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    darkTheme: Boolean = isSystemInDarkTheme(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val colorScheme = if (darkTheme) darkColorScheme(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        primary = Color(0xFF90CAF9),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        secondary = Color(0xFFA5D6A7)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) else lightColorScheme(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        primary = Color(0xFF1976D2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        secondary = Color(0xFF388E3C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    MaterialTheme(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        colorScheme = colorScheme,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        typography = AppTypography,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        content = content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 主题定义完全在 commonMain 中共享，各平台自动适配深色/浅色模式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"各平台入口\">各平台入口</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// androidMain&#10;class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        setContent {&#10;            AppTheme { AppNavigation() }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// desktopMain&#10;fun main() = application {&#10;    Window(onCloseRequest = ::exitApplication, title = &quot;KMP App&quot;) {&#10;        AppTheme { AppNavigation() }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {&#10;    return ComposeUIViewController {&#10;        AppTheme { AppNavigation() }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppTheme { AppNavigation() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// desktopMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = application {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Window(onCloseRequest = ::exitApplication, title = \"KMP App\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AppTheme { AppNavigation() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ComposeUIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AppTheme { AppNavigation() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Compose Multiplatform</strong> 将声明式 UI 共享扩展到 Android、iOS、Desktop 和 Web</li>\n<li>共享 Composable 函数与普通 Jetpack Compose 代码完全一致</li>\n<li>平台特定 UI（状态栏、返回按键）通过 <strong>expect/actual Composable</strong> 处理</li>\n<li>导航可使用自定义状态管理或第三方库（如 Voyager、Decompose）</li>\n<li>资源通过 <code>composeResources/</code> 目录统一管理，使用 <code>Res</code> 对象访问</li>\n<li>主题在 commonMain 中定义一次，各平台自动适配</li>\n<li>各平台入口代码极少，核心 UI 逻辑完全共享</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享 UI (Compose Multiplatform)","id":"共享-ui-compose-multiplatform"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构概览","id":"架构概览"},{"level":2,"text":"共享 Composable 编写","id":"共享-composable-编写"},{"level":3,"text":"共享屏幕组合","id":"共享屏幕组合"},{"level":2,"text":"平台特定 UI","id":"平台特定-ui"},{"level":2,"text":"导航","id":"导航"},{"level":2,"text":"资源管理","id":"资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"主题共享","id":"主题共享"},{"level":2,"text":"各平台入口","id":"各平台入口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/expect-actual"},"next":{"title":"平台 API 访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/platform-apis"}}